The rerun caught exactly the failure the prompt warns about: at 84 vertices, the bounded min-conflicts attack solved 1 of 8 held-out seeds, despite all three LLMs failing. I will not ship that preset. I’m sweeping only the predefined size axis to find the first level where the same attack is 0/8, then I’ll rerun all gates and the official harness from scratch so the final transcript matches the corrected module.
